  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.teachengineering.org/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">https://www.teachengineering.org/&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">수업&nbsp;아이디어(특히&nbsp;활동과&nbsp;확장질문)을&nbsp;얻을&nbsp;수&nbsp;있는&nbsp;사이트를&nbsp;소개합니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">첫&nbsp;페이지부터&nbsp;번역해서&nbsp;보시면&nbsp;편합니다.(번역할&nbsp;때는&nbsp;가급적&nbsp;크롬&nbsp;사용하세요^^)&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">찾고&nbsp;싶은&nbsp;주제가&nbsp;있으면&nbsp;그&nbsp;단어를&nbsp;대충&nbsp;영어로&nbsp;쳐보시면&nbsp;관련된&nbsp;것들이&nbsp;나올&nbsp;겁니다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">저는&nbsp;중학교&nbsp;1학년&nbsp;처음에&nbsp;나오는&nbsp;'지구내부구조'를&nbsp;찾고&nbsp;싶었어요.&nbsp;'earth&nbsp;inner&nbsp;structure'라고&nbsp;쓰고&nbsp;엔터,&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">그럼&nbsp;아래와&nbsp;같이&nbsp;여러가지&nbsp;활동이&nbsp;나옵니다.&nbsp;하나씩&nbsp;들어가보시면&nbsp;활동&nbsp;자체는&nbsp;익숙하지만,&nbsp;공학적인&nbsp;부분이나&nbsp;'왜&nbsp;이걸&nbsp;알아야&nbsp;하는가?'&nbsp;등과&nbsp;관련된&nbsp;부분에서&nbsp;아이디어를&nbsp;얻으실&nbsp;수&nbsp;있으실&nbsp;거예요^^</span><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A06A485A8A71F427\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"773\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"773\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"캡처_2018_02_19_15_32_46_850.png\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_99A06A485A8A71F4278E1D\"/></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996855485A8A71F423\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"773\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"773\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"캡처_2018_02_19_15_35_18_792.png\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_996855485A8A71F4232946\"/></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/998EA4485A8A71F511\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"1002\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"1002\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"캡처_2018_02_19_15_38_22_133.png\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_998EA4485A8A71F51179FB\"/></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><br></span>